# Engineering rules (always on)

**Full contract:** [`docs/ENGINEERING_RULES.md`](docs/ENGINEERING_RULES.md)
**Invariants:** [`docs/INVARIANTS.md`](docs/INVARIANTS.md) · **Auth:** [`docs/CLERK-AUTH.md`](docs/CLERK-AUTH.md)
**The invariants win** if this file and they disagree.

## Non-negotiables

- Backend is authoritative (BACK-01). The shell renders parsed replies; it maps backend enums to theme tokens but never derives status, lateness, health, or progress.
- One backend door: React → same-origin Astro endpoints → `aadm-backend`, with `request_id`, `api_version`, release ID, and a timeout. No secrets or backend URL in the browser.
- Field read models are zod schemas in `src/components/field/field-types.ts`; pages parse before React renders. Failed parse = visible error.
- Example data only in `src/components/field/fixtures/`, loaded by glob via `src/lib/field-fixtures.ts` when `PUBLIC_FIELD_FIXTURES=1`. Nothing imports a fixture directly. Deleting the folder needs no code change.
- Build from shared components; color only from `src/styles/theme.css` tokens; light and dark both work.
- IDs are server-made UUIDs (IDN-06). Session, not URL, is tenant authority.
- Login is `accounts.aadm.io` only; satellite off; do not repoint the CNAME.
